WEBVTT

00:00:05.907 --> 00:00:09.435
Choose Sponsors in the side menu.

00:00:09.685 --> 00:00:13.014
Click Demo Sponsor Ltd (test).

00:00:13.264 --> 00:00:16.167
Click Pause.

00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:21.823
Check that Sponsor paused. shows
at the bottom of the screen.

00:00:22.073 --> 00:00:26.926
Click Approve to run.

00:00:27.176 --> 00:00:32.717
Check that Sponsor approved.
shows at the bottom of the screen.

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:37.174
Click Archive.

00:00:37.424 --> 00:00:42.964
Check that Sponsor archived.
shows at the bottom of the screen.

00:00:43.214 --> 00:00:46.617
Click Sponsors in the top path.

00:00:46.867 --> 00:00:49.861
Click Demo Bakery (test).

00:00:50.111 --> 00:00:52.836
Click Delete sponsor.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:56.524
Click Delete.
